# QML UI patterns

- No torrent business logic in QML; call `appController` methods.
- Use `src/app/qml/Theme.qml` tokens for colors; support system dark/light via `Application.styleHints` when extended.
- Bind lists to Qt models (`appController.torrents`), not raw C++ pointers.
